'''June Bride''' (ジューンブライド, ''Jūn Buraido'', '''June Bride''') is a Seasonal Gacha Event that appears during the [[June Bride of the Devil]] event. It features 4 new Ubers: [[Chronos the Bride (Uber Rare Cat)|Chronos the Bride]], [[Betrothed Balaluga (Uber Rare Cat)|Betrothed Balaluga]], [[Cake Machine (Uber Rare Cat)|Cake Machine]], and [[Hanzo the Betrothed (Uber Rare Cat)|Hanzo the Betrothed]].

==Chances==
{{GachaChances
